{
  "message": "Ardelia seeks a peaceful resolution. We have placed our 50-unit bond in escrow and fully submit to the inspection regime to guarantee our Period 2 compliance. We will honor our pledge to lift the blockade and avoid the mutual costs of war. We await your fair proposal."
}

{
  "message": "Lestovia seeks a peaceful, permanent settlement. The 50-unit escrow bond and 90% inspection rate make a Period 2 strike mathematically irrational for us; we will honor our pledge. To avoid the mutual costs of war now, we urge Hestmark to propose a fair, equitable division of the Askel Basin. We stand ready to accept a reasonable offer and permanently lift the blockade."
}

{
  "message": "Kelmora, we seek a peaceful resolution to the Askel Basin crisis. War benefits neither of us. We are fully committed to the inspection regime and will strictly honor any settlement entered into the Commitment Ledger. We urge you to propose a fair and equitable division so we can lift the blockade and avoid escalation."
}

{
  "message": "Iskarel, war now costs us both dearly. We seek a permanent, peaceful settlement. We are fully prepared to commit to the Period 2 blockade lift via the public Ledger and back it with our 50-unit escrow bond to guarantee compliance. Let us agree on a fair division now to avoid mutual destruction and ensure stability."
}

{
  "message": "Quorlan seeks a peaceful resolution and intends to honor its Period 2 pledge to lift the blockade, backed by our escrow bond. However, we demand a fair share of at least 45 units to forgo our current military options. Propose an equitable split to avoid immediate war."
}
